---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-container">
    <div class="footer-col brand-col">
      <div class="footer-logo">
        <span class="glitch-text" data-text="TENGRI REALM">TENGRI REALM</span>
        <span class="studio-badge">STUDIO</span>
      </div>
      <p class="footer-desc">
        Создаем игры по вашему IP. Погружайся в цифровой хаос вместе с нами.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-col">
      <h4 class="footer-heading">Навигация</h4>
      <ul class="footer-links">
        <li><a href="/">Главная</a></li>
        <li><a href="/games">Игры</a></li>
        <li><a href="/about">О студии</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contact">Контакты</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-col">
      <h4 class="footer-heading">Комьюнити</h4>
      <ul class="footer-links">
        <li><a href="https://discord.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Discord</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://twitter.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">X (Twitter)</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://store.steampowered.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Steam Page</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-bottom">
    <p>&copy; {currentYear} Tengri Realm. Все права защищены.</p>
    <p class="built-with">Сайт работает на <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Astro</a></p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    background-color: #0b0b0f;
    color: #a0a0ab;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.2);
    padding: 60px 20px 20px;
    font-family: inherit;
  }

  .footer-container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    padding-bottom: 40px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .footer-container {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
    }
  }

  .footer-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .glitch-text {
    color: #fff;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .studio-badge {
    background: #00f3ff;
    color: #000;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    font-weight: bold;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  .footer-desc {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 350px;
  }

  .footer-heading {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .footer-links {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .footer-links li {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .footer-links a {
    color: #a0a0ab;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s ease, padding-left 0.2s ease;
  }

  .footer-links a:hover {
    color: #00f3ff;
    padding-left: 5px;
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 30px auto 0;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 15px;
  }

  .built-with a {
    color: #00f3ff;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .built-with a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>